{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"39":"Battles (Kitab Al-Malahim)"},"section_detail":{"39":{"hadithnumber_first":4291,"hadithnumber_last":4350,"arabicnumber_first":4291,"arabicnumber_last":4350,"name_native":"كتاب الملاحم"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4346,"arabicnumber":4346,"text":"حدثنا احمد بن يونس، حدثنا ابو شهاب، عن مغيرة بن زياد، عن عدي بن عدي، عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم نحوه قال \" من شهدها فكرهها كان كمن غاب عنها","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":39,"hadith":56}}]}